  "translation": "Na Shelomo i tok: Yu bin mekim wantaim wokman bilong yu, David papa bilong mi, bikpela khesed, olsem em i wokabaut pastaim long yu long tru olgeta, na long tsedek, na long stret bel wantaim yu; na yu bin lukautim gut long em ⟨את⟩ dispela khesed bikpela tru, na yu bin givim long em wanpela pikinini man i save sindaun long thron bilong em, olsem long dispela de.",
